\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Interactive analysis of the ProX--proline betaine complex (PDB 1R9Q)\mciteCiteA  {\@auxout }{main}{\relax }{\relax }{\cite }{schiefner2004cation}. LigPlot3D detects and visualizes hydrogen bonds (dashed lines), hydrophobic contacts, and cation--$\pi $ contacts to the surrounding aromatic cage in 3D; cation--$\pi $ contacts are listed within the $\pi $-stacking class. The sidebar provides granular control over visualization parameters and a detailed interaction table. This is also the structure loaded by the application's demo option.}}{11}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:loaded}{{2}{11}{Interactive analysis of the ProX--proline betaine complex (PDB 1R9Q)\cite {schiefner2004cation}. LigPlot3D detects and visualizes hydrogen bonds (dashed lines), hydrophobic contacts, and cation--$\pi $ contacts to the surrounding aromatic cage in 3D; cation--$\pi $ contacts are listed within the $\pi $-stacking class. The sidebar provides granular control over visualization parameters and a detailed interaction table. This is also the structure loaded by the application's demo option}{figure.caption.17}{}}
